The data were collected as a part of project Systemization of non-driving activities in the autonomous mode (CK03000063) co-financed from the state budget by the Technology agency of the Czech Republic and the Ministry of Transport within the Doprava 2020+ Programme.
Author contributions
Miroslava Horáková was leading the research team on project„Systemization of non-driving activities in the autonomous mode“. She wrote the article with the data and outputs obtained through the project. Following authors contributed to the realization of the project and preparing the manuscript: Lucie Vondráčková processed the data using statistical analyses, contributed to the data description and interpretation. Libor Krejčí was responsible for methodology and data acquisition, contributed to the creation of the project’s outputs. Martina Trepáčová processed the data using statistical analyses and contributed to the creation of the main project’s outputs. All authors have read and agreed the final version of manuscript.
